yin":"Wǒ qù yínháng qǔ qián.","fr":"Je vais retirer de l'argent à la banque.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 取 par « capturer » : une main, 又, qui tient une oreille, 耳. On coupait l'oreille gauche de l'ennemi pour compter les prises. De là « prendre, saisir, aller chercher ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 取 as “to capture”: a hand, 又, holding an ear, 耳. The left ear of an enemy was cut off to count the captures. Hence “to take, to seize, to fetch”.","roles":{"耳":"sens","又":"sens"}}},"娶":{"c":"娶","pinyin":"qǔ","lectures":["qǔ"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["耳","又","女"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3384"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"épouser (une femme)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"épouser (une femme), prendre pour femme"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他娶了一个北京姑娘。","pinyin":"Tā qǔ le yī ge Běijīng gūniang.","fr":"Il s'est marié avec une fille de Pékin.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"去":{"c":"去","pinyin":"qù","lectures":["qù"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0050","L1-0159","L1-0184","L1-0302","L1-0303","L2-0209","L3-0279","L3-0412","L3-0573","L3-0616","L3-0638","L3-0775","L6-0676","L7-0564","L7-0619","L7-1039","L7-1526","L7-1540","L7-1822","L7-2508","L7-3385","L7-3386","L7-3387"],"chemin":{"hsk":52,"lire":51},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"aller, quitter, enlever","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我明天去北京。","pinyin":"Wǒ míngtiān qù Běijīng.","fr":"Demain, je vais à Pékin.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你去哪儿？","pinyin":"Nǐ qù nǎr?","fr":"Où vas-tu ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Les formes anciennes de 去 reçoivent plusieurs interprétations, et cette fiche n'en retient aucune. Pour s'en souvenir : en haut, 土, la terre ; en bas, 厶, une petite boucle, comme un baluchon qu'on emporte. On quitte la terre où l'on était, baluchon en main : 去 veut dire « aller, partir ».","en":"The early forms of 去 are read in several ways, and this card does not pick one. As a memory aid: at the top, 土, the earth; at the bottom, 厶, a small loop, like a bundle taken along. You leave the ground you stood on, bundle in hand: 去 means “to go, to leave”.","roles":{}}},"趣":{"c":"趣","pinyin":"qù","lectures":["qù","cù"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","龰","耳","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0263","L4-0463","L4-0824","L4-0898","L7-1159","L7-3388"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"intérêt, attrait","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"intérêt, attrait, goût"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"圈":{"c":"圈","pinyin":"quān","lectures":["quān","juān","juàn"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["囗","龹","㔾"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0593","L7-2303","L7-3389","L7-3390","L7-4801"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cercle, rond, tour ; entourer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"cercle, rond ; tour"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"entourer, encercler"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"enclos, porcherie","pinyin":"juàn"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他在操场上跑了三圈。","pinyin":"Tā zài cāochǎng shang pǎo le sān quān.","fr":"Il a fait trois tours de piste.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"全":{"c":"全","pinyin":"quán","lectures":["quán"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","王"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0005","L2-0452","L2-0453","L2-0454","L2-0455","L2-0456","L2-0457","L2-0458","L2-0559","L3-0574","L3-0575","L3-0576","L5-0386","L5-0570","L5-0607","L5-0608","L6-0679","L6-0680","L7-0053","L7-1429","L7-2119","L7-2876","L7-3394","L7-3395","L7-3396","L7-3397","L7-3398","L7-3399","L7-3400","L7-3401","L7-4950"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"entier, complet ; tout","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"entier, complet"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"tout, entièrement"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这本书我全看完了。","pinyin":"Zhè běn shū wǒ quán kàn wán le.","fr":"J'ai lu ce livre en entier.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我全忘了。","pinyin":"Wǒ quán wàng le.","fr":"J'ai tout oublié.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi rattache 全 au jade, 玉, et dit qu'un jade pur, sans défaut, s'appelle 全. Il écrit aussi 仝, avec 入 sur 工 : ce qui entre intact. On lit aujourd'hui 人 sur 王 : le jade entier, sans défaut.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi links 全 to jade, 玉, and says that flawless pure jade is called 全. It also writes 仝, with 入 over 工: what goes in intact. Today you read 人 over 王: the whole, flawless jade.","roles":{"人":"forme","王":"sens"}}},"拳":{"c":"拳","pinyin":"quán","lectures":["quán"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["龹","手"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3402","L7-3403","L7-3988"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"poing ; boxe","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"poing"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"boxe, art martial à mains nues"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"plier, recroqueviller"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他每天早上打太极拳。","pinyin":"Tā měi tiān zǎoshang dǎ tàijíquán.","fr":"Il pratique le taiji tous les matins.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"权":{"c":"权","pinyin":"quán","lectures":["quán"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0594","L6-0677","L6-0678","L6-0689","L6-1062","L7-3309","L7-3391","L7-3392","L7-3393","L7-3797","L7-4044","L7-5365","L7-5454"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pouvoir, autorité ; droit","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"pouvoir, autorité"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"droit"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你没有权这样做。","pinyin":"Nǐ méiyǒu quán zhèyàng zuò.","fr":"Ce n'est pas à toi d'en décider.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"泉":{"c":"泉","pinyin":"quán","lectures":["quán"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["白","水"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0449","L5-0609","L7-3082","L7-4322","L7-5146"],"chemin":{},"sens